{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/formal-ai/pulls/976","id":4217096606,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSbOoU877W8me","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/976","diff_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/976.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/976.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/976","number":976,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(seed): recognize Hindi/Chinese infix arithmetic operator words","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nFixes #962.\n\n`2 जमा 2 कितना होता है?` (hi) and `2 加 2 等于多少?` (zh) fell to the unknown handler while `What is 2 plus 2?` and `Сколько будет 2 плюс 2?` answered correctly — a violation of the \"every operation is recognized equally across en | ru | hi | zh\" doctrine, since symbolic `2 + 2` already worked in all four languages.\n\n## Root causes\n\nReproducing each prompt in isolation (`experiments/issue_962_repro.rs`) separated **three** causes, not one:\n\n1. **Missing infix operator surfaces.** The `addition` meaning in `data/seed/meanings-calculator.lino` lexicalised only `जोड़` (hi) and `加上` (zh). The bare infix forms `जमा` and `加` were absent, so `contains_word_operator` found no operator and `has_calculation_signal` rejected the prompt as prose.\n2. **A missing Hindi result-query cue.** `2 जोड़ 2 कितना है?` answered; `2 जोड़ 2 कितना होता है?` did not. `calculation_result_query` carried `कितना है` but not `कितना होता है`, and cues are matched as phrases, not stems — `कितना है` is not a substring of `कितना होता है`. **Fixing cause 1 alone would have left the issue's first reported prompt broken.**\n3. **The gap was systematic.** Every other operator had the same shape: only the compound form was seeded (`减去`, `乘以`, `除以`, `भाग`), never the bare infix form. Per the issue's holistic-pass instruction, all of them are fixed.\n\n## Changes\n\nAll behaviour changes are **data, not code** — the recogniser already matched CJK surfaces as substrings and other scripts on token boundaries, across every language the meanings lexicalise.\n\n`data/seed/meanings-calculator.lino`:\n- `addition`: `जमा` (hi), `加` (zh)\n- `subtraction`: `减` (zh)\n- `multiplication`: `乘` (zh)\n- `division`: `बटा` (hi), `除` (zh)\n- `calculation_result_query`: `कितना होता है`, `कितने होते हैं` (hi)\n\nRegenerated artefacts (the `arithmetic_word_tables_match_seed` and self-AST census tests enforce parity, and both failed before regeneration):\n- `src/arithmetic_word_tables.rs` + its `tests/source/` mirror — via `cargo run -p formal-ai --example issue_386_gen_arith_table`\n- `data/meta/self-ast/` — via `cargo run --example regenerate_self_ast_census`\n\nPlus `docs/case-studies/issue-962/README.md` and a changelog fragment.\n\n## How to reproduce\n\n```sh\ncp experiments/issue_962_repro.rs examples/ && cargo run -p formal-ai --example issue_962_repro\n```\n\nBefore / after on the three reported prompts:\n\n| Prompt | Before | After |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `2 जोड़ 2 कितना होता है?` | `intent=unknown` | `intent=calculation`, `2 जोड़ 2 = 4` |\n| `2 जमा 2 कितना होता है?` | `intent=unknown` | `intent=calculation`, `2 जमा 2 = 4` |\n| `2 加 2 等于多少?` | `intent=unknown` | `intent=calculation`, `2 加 2 = 4` |\n\n## Tests\n\n- `tests/unit/issue_962_word_operator_parity.rs` — pins the three reported prompts, their en/ru counterparts, the symbolic forms (so the fix cannot regress what already worked), and minus/times/divide in hi and zh.\n- `tests/unit/multilingual_variations.rs` — new `arithmetic_hindi_word_variations_match` and `arithmetic_chinese_word_variations_match` blocks mirroring the existing English and Russian ones operator for operator.\n\nLocal results: `cargo test --test unit` 2557 passed / 0 failed; `cargo test --test source` 487 passed / 0 failed; `cargo fmt --check` and `cargo clippy --all-targets` clean. The 8 `tests/integration/issue_680_intent_routing` failures in this sandbox are pre-existing and environmental (`WouldBlock` binding a local HTTP socket) — verified to fail identically on the unmodified checkout.\n","created_at":"2026-08-06T01:25:54Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T02:47:24Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_e